# A50: assembly copies (se_assembly copy_assembly) and simplified assemblies (se_simplify on an assembly).
# A block 100 x 60 x 20 = 120000 mm3 and a pin Ø10 x 40 = 3141.593 mm3 at (200, 0, 0), saved as a source assembly.
@b = se_documents {"action":"new","kind":"part"}
@k = se_sketch {"action":"create","plane":"1"}
se_sketch {"action":"rectangle","sketch":"{{k.sketch}}","points":[0,0,100,60]}
se_sketch {"action":"close","sketch":"{{k.sketch}}"}
se_extrude {"sketch":"{{k.sketch}}","distance":20}
se_documents {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_blk.par","overwrite":true}
se_documents {"action":"close","saveChanges":false}
@p = se_documents {"action":"new","kind":"part"}
@pk = se_sketch {"action":"create","plane":"1"}
se_sketch {"action":"circle","sketch":"{{pk.sketch}}","center":[0,0],"radius":5}
se_sketch {"action":"close","sketch":"{{pk.sketch}}"}
se_extrude {"sketch":"{{pk.sketch}}","distance":40}
se_documents {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_pin.par","overwrite":true}
se_documents {"action":"close","saveChanges":false}
@s = se_documents {"action":"new","kind":"assembly"}
se_assembly {"action":"insert","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_blk.par"}
se_assembly {"action":"insert","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_pin.par","origin":[200,0,0]}
se_documents {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_source.asm","overwrite":true}
se_documents {"action":"close","saveChanges":false}
@m = se_documents {"action":"new","kind":"assembly"}
se_assembly {"action":"insert","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_blk.par"}
se_assembly {"action":"insert","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_pin.par","origin":[200,0,0]}
se_documents {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_positions.asm","overwrite":true}
se_assembly_family {"action":"create","members":["Closed","Open"]}
se_documents {"action":"save"}
se_documents {"action":"close","saveChanges":false}
# 1) Assembly copies: the source's components come in; mirrored about the YZ plane their centre of volume changes side
@a = se_documents {"action":"new","kind":"assembly"}
! [invalid_argument] se_assembly {"action":"copy_assembly","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_blk.par"}
! [copy_failed] se_assembly {"action":"copy_assembly","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_positions.asm"}
@c1 = se_assembly {"action":"copy_assembly","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_source.asm"}
?= c1.mirrored false
?= c1.occurrences[1].origin[0] 200
@v1 = se_physical {}
?= v1.volume 123141.593 0.01
?= v1.centerOfVolume[0] 53.827 0.01
! [copy_exists] se_assembly {"action":"copy_assembly","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_source.asm","plane":"2"}
se_documents {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_copy.asm","overwrite":true}
se_documents {"action":"close","saveChanges":false}
@a2 = se_documents {"action":"new","kind":"assembly"}
@c2 = se_assembly {"action":"copy_assembly","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_source.asm","plane":"2"}
?= c2.mirrored true
@v2 = se_physical {}
?= v2.centerOfVolume[0] -53.827 0.01
se_documents {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_mirror.asm","overwrite":true}
se_documents {"action":"close","saveChanges":false}
# 2) A simplified assembly without the pin, written as a part of the block alone
@o = se_documents {"action":"open","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_source.asm"}
@l = se_assembly {"action":"list"}
@s0 = se_simplify {"action":"status"}
?= s0.simplified false
! [invalid_argument] se_simplify {"action":"create"}
! [invalid_argument] se_simplify {"action":"create","ratio":1.5}
! [invalid_argument] se_simplify {"action":"delete_holes","diameter":5}
! [no_simplified_model] se_simplify {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_simple.par"}
@s1 = se_simplify {"action":"create","occurrences":["{{l.occurrences[1].handle}}"]}
?= s1.simplified true
?~ s1.excluded[0] a50_pin
! [invalid_argument] se_simplify {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_simple.asm"}
se_simplify {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_simple.par"}
@s2 = se_simplify {"action":"delete"}
?= s2.simplified false
se_documents {"action":"close","saveChanges":false}
@sp = se_documents {"action":"open","path":"{{work}}\\a50\\a50_simple.par"}
@v3 = se_physical {}
?= v3.volume 120000 0.01
se_documents {"action":"close","saveChanges":false}
